      "text": "Historically, **5 of 9** distinct scenarios have a run that met its configured memory target. The best single evaluation reached **3 of 9**. The latest complete October 30 evaluation reached **3 of 9**. Its first saved diagnosis rounds produced **5 of 9** valid correct first-cause diagnoses and **5 of 9** ready for patching; raw first-category matches were **5 of 9**. At the final stopping point, **5 of 9** diagnoses were valid and **3 of 9** remained ready. <!-- numbers: summary -->"
