    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "line": 108,
      "text": "Four scenarios have no recorded target success in this history. The latest complete October 30 evaluation met three of nine memory targets, below the target of six; matching a cause was often insufficient to produce a usable patch. The first-cause counts use the first saved diagnosis round, which can include correction requests within that round; raw category matches and validated diagnoses are separate measures. The two additional s2 precision-policy tests did not pass, and HF Trainer repair failed after a configuration edit passed its static check. They produced no successful memory-versus-speed comparison or new successful gallery cases."
