      "text": "The latest complete October 30 evaluation (R17) met **3/9 memory targets**. Its first saved diagnosis rounds produced **5/9 valid correct first causes**, **5/9 raw first-category matches**, and **5/9 ready diagnoses**, including **4/9 ready valid correct first causes**. At the final stopping point, **5/9** diagnoses were valid and **3/9** remained ready. The unchanged memory-target threshold is **6/9**, which was not met. Historical coverage remains five distinct successful scenarios and a best single evaluation of **3/9**. <!-- numbers: summary -->"
