      "text": "The [latest complete October 30 evaluation](../reports/r17-20261030-terminal-review/final-qualification-summary.json) and [R17 number checklist](../reports/docs-r17-draft-20261030/numbers-checklist.json) supply the complete result and selected s3/s8 provenance. The [later partial check](../reports/r18-20261030-terminal-review/final-qualification-summary.json) and [current number checklist](../reports/docs-r18-draft-20261030/numbers-checklist.json) supply the partial outcome and tied selected s1/s4 provenance. All previous evaluation rows and versioned number manifests remain preserved; the full earlier document below is unchanged."
